  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 884073,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## A Hundred Swords: Dreamcast\n\nForge your legend in *A Hundred Swords*, a unique and challenging tactical RPG for the Sega Dreamcast. Set in a dark medieval fantasy world, you lead a band of customizable warriors on a quest to defeat the tyrannical King Oberon and liberate the oppressed kingdom of Elysia. \n\nForget traditional turn-based combat – *A Hundred Swords* features a real-time, action-oriented battle system where positioning and timing are everything. Control a party of up to four heroes, each with distinct classes and abilities, and strategically maneuver them across the battlefield.  Experience brutal, visceral combat as you clash with hordes of enemies, utilizing special attacks and powerful skills. \n\nCustomize your heroes with a vast array of weapons and armor, enhancing their strengths and tailoring them to your preferred playstyle.  The game's distinctive art style and haunting soundtrack create a captivating atmosphere.  Prepare for a relentless and rewarding experience where every decision matters, and victory demands skill and cunning."
    },
